# ESP component manager writes this on the first successful
# `idf.py reconfigure`. Each developer (and each IDF version)
# produces a slightly different lock, so we ignore it locally
# and regenerate on demand. If your team prefers reproducibility
# over-per-developer, remove this line and commit the lock.
dependencies.lock
